  plan for the session and so we can accurately order enough pizza.  If you 
 find you are unable to attend\, please decline the calendar invite and remo
 ve yourself from the event registration list in Handshake.<br><br>Pizza wil
 l be served starting at 11:30 am and the presentation will start at 11:45 a
 m. Alicia Tran from MPR will be joining us virtuall starting at Noon. With 
 an extensive background in hiring and recruitment in a variety of sectors\,
  Alicia will share job fair and resume tips relevant to any student who pla
 ns on attending the fair.<br><br>The presentation portion of the workshop s
 hould be done by 12:30 pm.
