BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20251118T160000Z
DTEND:20251118T164500Z
DTSTAMP:20261026T181648Z
ORGANIZER;CN=Sorrel Hester:mailto:shester@macalester.edu
UID:us13fu6vjpjj22a86ns9qif4s4@google.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=Sorrel
  Hester;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:shester@macalester.edu
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=kwang2
 @macalester.edu;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:kwang2@macalester.edu
CREATED:20251113T233910Z
DESCRIPTION:Event Name\nmeet or walk with Chaplain Sorrel\n\nReserve up to 
 45 minutes of undivided time to drop by my CRSL office\, Zoom\, or another 
 location on campus. I'm also available to go on a walk if you'd like a "wal
 k and talk" meeting.\n\n\nI'm available to discuss whatever is on your hear
 t or mind! There's no pressure to have a "formal religious reason" to talk 
 to me. I'm here to talk life\, relationships\, family\, politics\, Scriptur
 e\, your relationship to faith/spirituality\, your favorite TV at the momen
 t and other matters.\n\n\nThere is no pressure to keep the entire allotted 
 time. Remember\, this time is for you and you're welcome to end the convers
 ation whenever you'd like.\n\n\nA note about masking: I have two invisible 
 disabilities and am immunocompromised! I need my office to be a required tw
 o-way masked zone. I can provide a mask for you if you do not have one. If 
 you are not comfortable masking\, let's find another way to meet!\n\n\nPlea
 se indicate if you'd like to meet outside\, Zoom\, upstairs\, the LC indoor
  track\, or have another location in mind!\n\nLocation: CRSL\, Weyerhauser 
 Chapel\, Lower Level\, Room 108 - Please indicate if you'd like to meet els
 ewhere besides the chapel. Some options include but aren't limited to going
  on a walk\, Zoom\, etc.\n\nPlease share anything that will help prepare fo
 r our meeting.: Thank you so much for checking in! Yes\, I’m definitely sti
 ll interested in meeting. Nothing special you need to prepare — I would jus
 t love to share tea and chat with you. If it’s possible\, could you bring o
 ne pebble for me? I would really appreciate it!\n\nNeed to make changes to 
 this event?\nCancel: https://calendly.com/cancellations/281a1c14-666e-49d7-
 bed9-45c532784283\nReschedule: https://calendly.com/reschedulings/281a1c14-
 666e-49d7-bed9-45c532784283\n\nPowered by Calendly.com\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260403T165830Z
LOCATION:CRSL\, Weyerhauser Chapel\, Lower Level\, Room 108
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:kristen wang and Chaplain Sorrel Virginia Hester
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
