UID:57q00h84m344ccmdbqhmeccjt8@google.com
CREATED:20260921T174636Z
DESCRIPTION:Edit Registration: https://apply.girlswhoinvest.org/register/?k
 =a95ad094-74d7-4a14-99b7-ced09cca9242\n Join: https://apply.girlswhoinvest.
 org/share/view?id=a95ad094-74d7-4a14-99b7-ced09cca9242\n\n Join us for a vi
 rtual fireside chat with Christina Scarlato\, Principal Portfolio Manager a
 t World Bank. In this engaging conversation\, we'll ask Christina questions
  about her educational and professional path\, her experiences navigating n
 ew spaces\, the work she does now as an investor\, her vision for the indus
 try\, and so much more. Christina will also provide advice for future GWI S
 cholars. You don't want to miss this!\n\nChristina Scarlato is Principal Po
 rtfolio Manager and leads the Real Assets Team at the World Bank Pension Fu
 nd. She is responsible for strategic planning\, oversight of existing inves
 tments\, and the evaluation of prospective managers across global real asse
 ts. Christina has been with the World Bank Pension Fund since 2007 and prev
 iously held roles across several departments within the World Bank Treasury
 . She currently serves on the boards of the PREA Foundation and Coffee Conn
 ectors and on the Advisory Board of Alliance Global Advisors. She previousl
 y served as Chairperson of the PREA Board. Christina holds a BA in Mathemat
 ics and Spanish from Seton Hall University and an MBA from The George Washi
 ngton University.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T174636Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Fireside Chat with Christina Scarlato\, Principal Portfolio Manager
  at World Bank
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
