CREATED:20250731T105000Z
DESCRIPTION:Greetings! You signed up for the camping 101 trip the sustainab
 ility office is hosting in collaboration with Outing Club. We are very exci
 ted for this trip! I will send out some additional logistics/details closer
  to the date but wanted to give you some information now.<br><br>We are pla
 nning on leaving for William O Brian State Park around 2 PM Saturday Octobe
 r 11th. We will return to campus Sunday October 12th around 1pm.<br><br>Whi
 le at the park you will learn how to set up and sleep in a tent\, make a ca
 mpfire and cook over a campfire\, and some other camping basics. You do not
  need to bring/own camping gear. We will borrow gear from the Macalester Ge
 ar Room. You may be sharing a tent with another student. If you have any re
 quests for who you share a tent with just let us know (please email both Me
 gan Butler). <br><br>In October the temperatures start dip into the 30s at 
 night. If you are worried that you do not have outdoor clothing or warm eno
 ugh clothing\, stop by 1550 summit Monday from 1-4 and grab a few extra lay
 ers just in case! <br><br>If you have any questions feel free to let me kno
 w! If your schedule has changed and you are no-longer able to make it to th
 e trip please let me know so that I can open up the opportunity to another 
 student. Either way\, <b><u>please accept this calendar invite to confirm y
 ou will be attending!</u></b>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260118T193206Z
LOCATION:William O Brien State Park  Meet at the Sustainability Office 
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Camping 101
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
